MERGE (n:Chunk {chunk_id: "SYN-6977197-01#0"}) SET n += {text: "Initial claim intake for Camila Morris. The worker is associated with MetroClean Services in the retail trade sector. The workplace incident occurred on December 15, 2025 at Nassau County retail store. The reported event involved fall, slip or trip injury - from liquid or grease spills. The resulting condition is described as strain or tear, affecting the knee. The claim was assembled on January 2, 2026. The public claim record identifies STARBUCKS CORPORATION as the carrier and lists the current status as NO FURTHER ACTION. This is a synthetic narrative created from public structured claim attributes.", position: 0, n_words: 96};
